description: ShadCN and shared component import paths
globs: src/lib/shadcn/**/*,src/shared/components/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# UI / ShadCN

- Primitives: `@/lib/shadcn/components/ui/...` (and related utils under `@/lib/shadcn/`).
- App-level shared components: `@/shared/components/...`.
- **Ignore** `components.json` aliases like `@/components` / `@/lib/utils` — they do not match this tree.
- Prefer existing shared wrappers (Button, DataTable, AlertDialog) over re-implementing primitives in features.
- Colocate component docs/tests next to the component when present.
